OL,3,GNEWSATown seeks crier to continue
OL,4,A450-year tradition
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town is seeking a new town crier to
OL,7,Fkeep alive a 450 year tradition.
OL,9,FKendal Town Council is looking to
OL,10,Freplace Richard Matthews who held the
OL,11,Frole for 14 years and retired in June.
OL,13,FThe authority's events and civic
OL,14,Fofficer, Simon Unsworth, said the new
OL,15,Ftitle-holder would have to be "slightly
OL,16,Fextroverted", ring a bell at civic
OL,17,Fevents, and "bring people's attention
OL,18,Fto things".
OL,20,FShortlisted applicants will then face
OL,21,Foff in a public cry at a farmers'
OL,22,Fmarket in November, Unsworth said.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
